{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ac162b057f04fd91b32249a31962aae698963a335ad753468fa885ee2a792864", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのオーディション中、\n面白い子を見つけた）", "zh": "（在39PROJECT的甄选中，\n我发现了一个有趣的孩子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f3d74c157b3427a87337549e090a159e3d9f8945c120dad1bc280fd7cb3bb30f", "ja": "（田中琴葉……歌もダンスも高得点で審査を通過。\nもしかしたら、この子は逸材かもしれない）", "zh": "（田中琴叶……唱歌跳舞都高分通过审查，\n她说不定是个优秀人才。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f6ceda75906e5c9f4b6ec61e717dc9b8874c7710dce12ce0510f4d8242926182", "ja": "……それじゃ、最後に自己PRをお願いできるかな？", "zh": "……那最后可以请你来一段自我推荐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "dca27c3a70e30b676a4722b1050f865c78bd7bec8fa1b0c2b16566fed2144881", "ja": "は、はい！\n改めまして、田中琴葉と言います。", "zh": "好、好的！\n让我再次介绍自己，我叫做田中琴叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "32eea417f09f528a5b629d367f30eda00b5c21bd9f17a47e8795b94c9954ab9b", "ja": "私は小さい頃から演劇や舞台が大好きで。母に頼んで、\nいろいろな劇場に連れて行ってもらいました。", "zh": "我从小就很喜欢戏剧和舞台，\n曾拜托妈妈带我去过许多座剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "ecb603a5a2b475cbead6095331f23d6da25314d1f17985e1c5a7fca7c523a311", "ja": "お芝居やミュージカル……。\nどれも素晴らしく、たくさん感動させてもらいました。", "zh": "不管是戏剧或音乐剧……\n每出都十分精采，让我非常感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b5ec8d161e1b7b0c2d7da27f209582cc3e0f3be3a94fac87505a30cb50bc497f", "ja": "（緊張しながらも、丁寧に語っている……。\nつい話に引き込まれてしまうな）", "zh": "（她虽然紧张，但说得很用心……\n让人忍不住听得入神。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "33555407c6364a925eca33f3b34b642829fef13d75177b855a0ae5ce43091638", "ja": "それで……いつの間にか、思うようになったんです。\n自分でも、あんな感動を生み出してみたい。", "zh": "所以……不知不觉间，\n我也开始希望自己也能创造出那种感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "173542febabb56109ec1368496e6141ac6d89407c6ab6e8baf3b2e9da9e22ab7", "ja": "いつか自分が舞台に立って、\n多くの人に感動してもらいたい、って。", "zh": "我希望将来自己也能站上舞台，\n带给许多人感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "bfed948ad68629e42466ddfacc0c5a0ec9e22938b3fd5c2d7eba40794e37e5ae", "ja": "そんな思いもあって、中学から演劇部に入部しました。\n自分なりに、真剣に取り組んで来たつもりです。", "zh": "基于这种想法，我从国中就加入话剧社。\n一路以自己的方式认真参与社团。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1cf1c74942ecee826ff9731521e4b580f5b22576531eb4cfe2129a1332d3fb67", "ja": "なるほど、いいと思うよ。\n演劇部は楽しかった？", "zh": "原来如此，我觉得很好啊。\n话剧社好玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd7877381076a00bdd14494c532b0bcee57ff1cd7bc1c416191724cfe11bc214", "ja": "はい！　仲間と一緒に舞台を作り上げていく作業が\n向いていたんだと思います。毎日、充実していました。", "zh": "是的！我觉得自己很擅长和伙伴们一起打造舞台，\n每天都过得很充实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "530db61fdaaea82dcfbc0310c5b28516f3d7c9cca81c786a1f4f3c30b0a31169", "ja": "それはよかった。でも演劇が好きなら、\n劇団に応募した方がよかったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "那就太好了。但既然喜欢戏剧，\n去报名剧团不是比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "64befa56c337158635766c6ef97a4275e3ef0f412e30b0d7b865f003468cb02a", "ja": "そ、それは、その……アイドルも、\nドラマや演劇に出てるのをよく見かけますし……。", "zh": "那、那是，那个……\n我也常看到偶像参与电视剧跟戏剧表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "bd82c6a55f9f21a5e4bfe9ec8da2fda71ba5eac47b306ed2c00cea78d57f607c", "ja": "ただ舞台に立つだけでも、あんなに……\nステキな笑顔で輝けるのが、すごいなと思って……。", "zh": "而且偶像光是站上舞台，就能……\n用那么灿烂的笑容发光发热，我觉得很厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fd2c777d474cb77aa6cfb3b419977dabf2687b515590171ad661f3c22303fc0b", "ja": "（最終的には、単純なアイドルへの憧れ……。\nといったところかな）", "zh": "（结果重点还是在于对偶像的单纯向往……\n应该是这样吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fabbac5a2be75b88eb3f06de8ec80f4ea725960debac79c271f37caabee47bc7", "ja": "ちなみに、このオーディションには自分で応募を？", "zh": "对了，你是自己报名这场甄选的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "6896cf5e3776312d1ad4f40f1053fa3b67b3bf7cb8459f29489531c79111e46c", "ja": "はい。……あ、でもきっかけは、\n友達にすすめられたことかな……。", "zh": "是的……\n啊，不过契机来自朋友的推荐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "4e2bd5e03dcffeb16fae3fb4eb73aacf8dc6d3b3d4f0e91ae11d5fb2b683e3e0", "ja": "街を歩いていて、39プロジェクトのポスターを\n見かけたんです。そこでみんなが盛り上がって……。", "zh": "我们走在路上时，看到了39PROJECT的海报。\n然后大家就热烈讨论了起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "edbd25bd95976ea0138b7f1b6efe6e33a76165ee2d0539743ef4b87e6ad177d6", "ja": "なるほど。応募してみれば？\nとか言われたのかな。", "zh": "原来如此，她们是跟你说\n「要不要报名看看？」之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "a4a05ad7dbdaa0098aa626934d73a737e8700129c68d9b3eff4a5a03a7daa5e5", "ja": "そうなんです。\n「琴葉なら絶対大丈夫だから」って……。", "zh": "是的。\n她们说「琴叶一定没问题的」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "16551ec3441a2794d4b772134bdbae929b1fa83d70f64de00fd45496dc8f160d", "ja": "その後、ひとりになって改めて考えてみて、\n応募することを決めました。", "zh": "事后我也有自己好好想过，\n就决定报名了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "d8daeae42ae61cd61133c06338072c8038f84114bc5bc210c167c87984b02627", "ja": "それから演劇部の顧問の先生、両親にも話をして……\nみんな、頑張れと送り出してくれました。", "zh": "那之后也去找话剧社的指导老师和爸妈讨论过……\n大家都很支持我、替我加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "b0cc0f48a76e814ae82bbbe75b22e92c9af01f3d652ff5f6a0af199286851f79", "ja": "だから……みんながっかりしないように、\n絶対、合格しなくちゃ……。", "zh": "所以……为了不让大家失望，\n我绝对非录取不可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5838a3a2be043e86635a8fe41a64da5c08ea04805dd436588bd81eb47364e361", "ja": "ん？　今、君がここにいるのは、\nみんなへの責任感から？", "zh": "嗯？你现在站在这里，\n是出于对大家的责任心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "0739153ada186912dd1601cc8bb63908c16e24efeb61a94ed62b10c25754ca2a", "ja": "えっ？　いえ、私がここにいるのは、\nオーディションに合格……するため……。", "zh": "咦？不，我来这里，\n是为了能在甄选中……被录取……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "09d1d20cd32e72602cc921043fca1e21249f2c1c99ad2acb6e2c7be53821d1f6", "ja": "いえ。私は、私の意志でここにいます。\n私自身が、あの舞台に立ちたいから……。", "zh": "不，我是基于个人意愿而来的。\n是我自己想站上那个舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "686bbe8fb02c96db82ced1f0c8ae5b53cc534479f8eb45872d4084eda80c1b36", "ja": "アイドルになりたいから、ここにいます！", "zh": "我是因为想成为偶像，才来到这里的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1029_p", "source_sha256": "2f1003a40793c02ad47cf9ce55fc63d935065ed0b971bee9461a76f51d660a63", "ja": "（……この目を見れば、嘘じゃないのはわかる。\n向上心もあるし、責任感もある。なら、答えは……）", "zh": "（……看着她的双眼，就知道这不是谎言。\n她既有上进心，也有责任感。那我的回答就是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_1030", "source_sha256": "7f8354a6527db909d196ec480e15d6a619dba6369e42758706f5d9526ae4c968", "ja": "合格！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1c889c2ec4f35361a25d7491574cb1f0c26dee00c8e6e12d63d26c9d870869ef", "ja": "田中琴葉さん、合格だ！　歌もダンスも演技も、\nそして覚悟も。一緒にトップアイドルを目指そう！", "zh": "田中琴叶小姐，你被录取了！你的歌声、舞蹈、演技，\n还有决心都合格。一起以顶尖偶像为目标努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "78ae28c52d5c56dcb35a8918058e5e7b165ebb79d039215b82d429a55064616a", "ja": "え……。ほ、本当ですか！？\nそれじゃ私、本当に……アイドルに……。", "zh": "咦……真、真的吗！？\n所以我真的……可以当上偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_2002_017kth", "source_sha256": "f69fbfce48efff69798e3cd5df368ecce2278f5aeecb026c08adc8fbc962c7c9", "ja": "よかった……！\nこれでみんなも、きっと……！", "zh": "太好了……！\n这样大家一定也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_017kth_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_017kth_001_2003_017kth", "source_sha256": "b149391d8982eecbf024b4e2e47b4dd50044e13363b7af07dae150a8129bee86", "ja": "あっ。いえ、あの……。\nとても……とても、うれしいです。私が……！", "zh": "啊。不，那个……\n我非常……非常高兴。这是我自己的心情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
